 of color created from your palette.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\" chill\",\" zen\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"loop\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"defaultValue\":true},{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"nColorsPerFrame\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":2,\"minValue\":2,\"maxValue\":50},{\"name\":\"linDirection\",\"type\":\"string\",\"defaultValue\":\"right\",\"strings\":[\"left\",\"right\",\"up\",\"down\"]}]},{\"uuid\":\"70b7c636-6bf8-491f-89c1-f4103508d642\",\"name\":\"Highlight\",\"description\":\"Just like random, but you will mostly see the first color of your palette. The other colors fade in periodically.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"chill\",\" zen\"],\"features\":[\"touch\",\"dynamicPalette\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":15,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"mainColorProb\",\"type\":\"double\",\"defaultValue\":80.0,\"minValue\":0.0,\"maxValue\":100.0}]},{\"uuid\":\"713518c1-d560-47db-8991-de780af71d1e\",\"name\":\"Burst\",\"description\":\"Your palette colors radiate out from the center of the panels.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"chill\",\" zen\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"loop\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"defaultValue\":true},{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":0,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"b3fd723a-aae8-4c99-bf2b-087159e0ef53\",\"name\":\"Fade\",\"description\":\"The Light Panels cycle through your palette colors all together.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"chill\",\" zen\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"loop\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"defaultValue\":true},{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":0,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"ba632d3e-9c2b-4413-a965-510c839b3f71\",\"name\":\"Random\",\"description\":\"This will take your palette colors and randomly animate them across your panels.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\" happy\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600},{\"name\":\"delayTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":0,\"minValue\":0,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"bc6fe7e0-36d4-4f95-aa21-52a386daa9dc\",\"name\":\"Ripple\",\"description\":\"Wisps of color dance across the display, creating a majestic ripple effect outwards based on the music's intensity. \",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"chill\",\" pop\",\" vibrant\",\" accoustic\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"fa0ce428-ad3a-40a9-84e4-1c9316644852\",\"name\":\"Classic Visualizer\",\"description\":\"An ode to the old school music visualizer. Your palette colors will be assigned left to right. Depending on your layout, colors may not all show up for larger palettes.\",\"author\":\"Nathan\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\" electronic\",\" vibrant\",\" pop\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"fe0d0ba8-741f-4210-940c-454eceed010f\",\"name\":\"Sound Bar\",\"description\":\"Two of your favorite colors compete in a dance-off to the intensity of music. The length of your setup will determine the direction the soundbar will go. Works best for softer music.\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"ambient\",\" acoustic\",\" classical\",\" vocal\",\" chill\"],\"features\":[]},{\"uuid\":\"b6aa071f-8377-4a04-819b-6fe8a7adb44c\",\"name\":\"Snakes on a Plane\",\"description\":\"If you're tired of these monkey fighting snakes on your Monday-Friday planes, try putting them up on your wall instead!\",\"author\":\"Nanoleaf\",\"type\":\"color\",\"tags\":[\"zen \",\"ambient\"],\"features\":[\"touch\"],\"pluginConfig\":[{\"name\":\"transTime\",\"type\":\"int\",\"defaultValue\":24,\"minValue\":1,\"maxValue\":600}]},{\"uuid\":\"fa987895-9612-41c6-9ff4-b1d02cf5ce18\",\"name\":\"LightCycle\",\"description\":\"Take your Aurora out for a ride on the digital frontier where good and evil are locked in an eternal battle for cyberspace\",\"author\":\"Seratonik\",\"type\":\"rhythm\",\"tags\":[\"party\",\"dim\",\"warm\",\"ambient\",\"cool\"],\"features\":[]}]}"}]}
